== A. the Kotlin node KE joins through the Silica sentinel S
A1 KE asked S for its three stores and S holds KE in its edge store: yes
A2 KE keeps the sentinel it joined through; its sentinel store: 9e1113ab@0
== B. the Silica node A joins through the Kotlin sentinel KS
B1 A asked KS for its three stores and KS holds A in its edge store: yes
B2 A keeps the sentinel it joined through; its sentinel store: e4188f0a@0
== C. shuffles started by each side and answered by the other
C1 a peer shuffles an entry for x2 (age 3) into KE; KE's edge store: 12eb7f44@3
C2 a peer shuffles KE's entry (age 5) into A; A's edge store: 1fae2ad7@5
C3 A ticks: it shuffles with KE, which answers with x2; A's edge store: 12eb7f44@3
C3 KE holds A, whose entry came in the shuffle; KE's edge store: b19edad2@0 12eb7f44@3
C4 KE ticks: its oldest entry is x2, where nobody listens; the partner is dropped, the entry sent is put back; KE's edge store: b19edad2@1
C5 KE ticks: it shuffles with A, which answers; A's edge store: 1fae2ad7@0 12eb7f44@3
C5 KE's edge store: 12eb7f44@3
C6 S ticks its edge store, which is not of its own type: it shuffles with KE without an entry of its own and keeps KE: merged
C7 KS ticks its edge store: it shuffles with A and puts A back at age 0 (ruling NQ-15); KS's edge view: b19edad2@0 12eb7f44@3 1fae2ad7@0
C8 KE ticks its sentinel store: it shuffles with S, a sentinel of its whitelist: merged
C9 A ticks its sentinel store: it shuffles with KS, a sentinel of its whitelist: merged
== D. what the Silica node A refuses, the Kotlin node KE refuses, with the same audit lines
D1 a good peer's sample: the peer sees: reply sample_reply; both nodes: admitted peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f tempus_edge, token and proof of possession
D2 an expired token: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admission_refused peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f the token has expired
D3 a token not valid yet: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admission_refused peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f the token is not valid yet
D4 a token under an old kid: the peer sees: key_rotated at=challenge kid=6b31; both nodes: key_rotated peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f the peer's token is under another kid; it was told the current one
D5 a token another key signed: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admission_refused peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f the signature does not verify
D6 a token issued for another key: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admission_refused peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f sub is not the peer's key
D7 a sentinel token under a certificate that is not in the whitelist: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: whitelist_reject peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f a tempus_bridge or tempus_sentinel token under a certificate that is not in the tempus whitelist
D8 a certificate of the whitelist with an edge token: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: whitelist_reject peer=9e1113ab416dc197 a certificate of the tempus whitelist with a token whose typ is not tempus_bridge or tempus_sentinel
D9 an advert for another key than the certificate's: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: binding_refused peer=12eb7f449478f2aa the advert's pub is not the key of the peer's TLS certificate
D10 a proof made with another key: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: pop_failed peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f the proof of possession does not verify
D11 no proof: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: pop_failed peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f a response was expected
D12 a sample where the challenge is due: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f a challenge was expected
D13 an advert above the frame ceiling: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: protocol_error peer=- frame refused before decoding: too_large
D14 a request above the frame ceiling: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admitted peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f tempus_edge, token and proof of possession / [tempus audit] protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f frame refused before decoding: too_large
D15 a peer that closes after its advert: the peer sees: closed, on purpose; both nodes: closed_by_peer peer=(any) stage (any)
D16 a sample of 9 where the shuffle length is 3: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admitted peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f tempus_edge, token and proof of possession / [tempus audit] protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f n is not 1 to the shuffle length
D17 a sample of 3 from the bridge store, whose shuffle length is 2: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admitted peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f tempus_edge, token and proof of possession / [tempus audit] protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f n is not 1 to the shuffle length
D18 four entries where the greatest shuffle length is 3: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admitted peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f tempus_edge, token and proof of possession / [tempus audit] protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f more entries than the shuffle length
D19 three entries for the bridge store, whose shuffle length is 2: the peer sees: closed; both nodes: admitted peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f tempus_edge, token and proof of possession / [tempus audit] entry_refused peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f entry 0: typ is not the store's type
