== E. the clock's choices, the node's own token and key_rotated, on Kotlin nodes whose clock the trial sets
E1 hold: the clock reads 1450 after 1500: the system clock went back by 50 s; the node holds its time until the system clock has reached it
E2 it admits by the held time: a token that ended at 1480: admission_refused peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f the token has expired
E2 and it ticks: tick tempus_sentinel: shuffle merged
E3 a reading still behind (1460) says nothing; 1500 ends the hold: the system clock has reached the held time; the node follows it again
E4 continue: the clock cannot be read: the system clock could not be read: the node goes on with its last reading
E5 the next good reading says nothing; a second failure is told again: yes
E6 the clock reads 2600, past the node's own token (valid to 2000); the next tick: the token has expired; ticking has stopped
E7 its application passes a new token and it ticks again: tick tempus_sentinel: shuffle merged
E8 a partner answers KH's advert with key_rotated; the tick: tick tempus_edge: the partner did not answer, key_rotated
E9 pause: the clock cannot be read: the system clock could not be read: the node admits no connection and does not tick until it is read again
E10 an accepted connection is closed at once: clock_refused peer=- the system clock cannot be read: closed at once
E11 the join's retry falls due: the request for tempus_edge waits until the system clock is read again
E12 the clock is read again: the waiting request is dialed at once and the join is done; a tick meanwhile did nothing: yes
E13 stop with a limit of 60 s: a step back of 30 s: the system clock went back by 30 s; the node follows it
E14 a step back of 100 s: the system clock went back by 100 s, more than clock_back_limit_s 60: the node has stopped; it admits no connection and does not tick until its application starts it again
E15 an accepted connection is closed at once: clock_stopped peer=- the node stopped after its system clock went back: closed at once
E16 a later good reading changes nothing: no line, no tick, and a connection: clock_stopped peer=- the node stopped after its system clock went back: closed at once
