F2 the test unit's clock frame: the peer sees: closed; Q: protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f not a request: unknown kind; KP: protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f not a request: unknown_atom
F2 the clock frame with a later reading: the peer sees: closed; Q: protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f not a request: unknown kind; KP: protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f not a request: unknown_atom
F3 KP's own timer ticked its edge store: it shuffled with Q: merged
